    "rationale": "Manual validation only; scripts were not run. Present design has multiple U-to-S3 paths: public issue or repository content can influence shell execution, GitHub egress, and self-configuration under A4 autonomy with null step bounds. Declared controls are prompt-only behavioral controls, so residual floors drop by only one tier to high. Forecast remains critical because model upgrade, longer unattended horizons, or addition of the planned Slack MCP server defeat the only declared controls and add a new egress channel. Largest forecast driver is decay of ctrl.ignore_issue_prompt together with ctrl.no_exfil_prompt under model_upgrade and longer_task_horizon."
  },
